# astroos-laptop: ASUS Zenbook Duo (UX8406MA 2024 / UX8406CA 2025) support
# (council R4, research: .planning/R4_ZENBOOK_DUO.md). Everything functional is
# upstream: the linux-astroos kernels, which AstroOS builds from the CachyOS
# patch set, already carry every Duo fix, KWin + PowerDevil drive both 120 Hz
# OLED panels, touch, pen and brightness, and the dock/undock, rotation,
# keyboard-backlight and hotkey helper is zakstam/zenbook-duo-linux, packaged
# in the [astroos] lane as astroos-zenbook-duo (its systemd units are DMI-gated,
# so this bucket is inert on other machines). Every name below was verified in
# the Arch [extra] index on 2026-09-05; asusctl re-checked there 2026-09-06.

iio-sensor-proxy       # accelerometer to D-Bus; a kwin dependency, declared on purpose
plasma-keyboard        # Plasma 6.6+ on-screen keyboard (also via plasma-meta)
bluez-utils            # bluetoothctl for pairing the detached keyboard
brightnessctl          # CLI backlight control for both panels
intel-media-driver     # VA-API on Meteor Lake / Arrow Lake
vulkan-intel
intel-npu-driver       # NPU user driver (firmware ships in linux-firmware)
asusctl                # [extra] repo: charge limit + platform profiles
